Portions of extensions/tool-renderers.ts and extensions/output-chrome.ts are
derived from pi-polish 0.1.1, which carries the same MIT terms:

Copyright (c) 2026 Thomas van Dongen

Those portions were subsequently modified: Shiki syntax highlighting was
replaced with pi's own highlighter, the word-level diff was reimplemented
locally, and the colour palettes were retuned. The prompt markers from
pi-polish were dropped.
